F. J. Harris, "On the use of windows for harmonic analysis with the discrete Fourier transform", *Proc. IEEE* 66:51–83 (1978);
D. G. Nishimura, *Principles of Magnetic Resonance Imaging*;
M. A. Bernstein, K. F. King, X. J. Zhou, *Handbook of MRI Pulse Sequences* (Elsevier, 2004).*
